<title>GREECE: Greek CPI inflation drops to 6.0 y/y in March.</title>
<headline>Greek CPI inflation drops to 6.0 y/y in March.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek consumer price inflation dropped to 6.0 percent year-on-year in March from 6.6 percent in February, National Economy Minister Yannos Papandoniou told a news conference. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
